      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "ChatGPT and Codex integrations help Clay users research deals and turn data into go-to-market plays, and GPT‑6 models handle the reasoning.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/clay-plugins-openai",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:58.185Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Using GPT‑6 Astra, GPT‑6 Sol, and other models, Clay enables users to build lists of companies and people, enrich those records using agents, and use that information in go-to-market plays.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/clay-plugins-openai",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:58.185Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Clay also brings these capabilities to where customers are already working with plugins for Codex and ChatGPT, making it easier to create and run go-to-market workflows and research accounts and deals.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/clay-plugins-openai",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:58.185Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "“Clay in ChatGPT gives sales reps a way to understand more about the customers they’re trying to sell to.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/clay-plugins-openai",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:58.185Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Clay’s Codex integration lets builders create and run go-to-market plays in Codex, while giving sales reps access to data they can use to research an account or understand a deal they’re trying to close.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/clay-plugins-openai",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:58.185Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Clay’s ChatGPT plugin brings the same customer data into another tool reps already use, helping them learn more about prospects without leaving ChatGPT.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/clay-plugins-openai",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:58.185Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "OpenAI models power Claygent’s research, qualification, enrichment, and signal detection, as well as the agent that helps users build workflows and coordinate other Clay agents.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/clay-plugins-openai",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:58.185Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Clay uses GPT‑6 Sol as its primary model, with GPT‑6 Astra for harder tasks and GPT‑6 Luna for cost-sensitive work.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/clay-plugins-openai",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:58.185Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "GPT‑6 Astra also helps Jeff build and test software.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/clay-plugins-openai",
        "source": "OpenAI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:58.185Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For Clay’s customers, Jeff sees GPT‑Live‑1 as a way to use Clay and Codex by voice and help prospects learn about a product.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/clay-plugins-openai",
        "source": "OpenAI",
